            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this unit ends a Charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of this unit and roll one D6 for each model in this unit: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. </characteristic>
